tpot‑honeypot‑lab
End‑to‑end honeypot + AutoML (TPOT) pipeline for attack analytics. This repository contains everything you need to run a simple SSH/HTTP honeypot, parse and featurise its logs, automatically train a classifier with TPOT, evaluate the resulting model and deploy it as a prediction API. The goal of this project is educational: it shows how to combine security instrumentation with modern machine learning workflows in a reproducible way.

