📈 Roadmap & contributing
This lab is an educational starting point, not a final product. There are many possible improvements: adding richer features (e.g. TLS JA3 fingerprints, geo lookups), incorporating anomaly detection for unlabeled data, integrating telemetry traces, or parameterising TPOT search via environment variables. We welcome contributions! Please see CONTRIBUTING.md for details on how to file issues, submit patches and follow our coding standards. A few issues labelled good first issue have been pre‑seeded to help new contributors get started.

